tyle=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter sizing reset-size3 size6\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0543em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.656em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2255em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line mtight\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.049em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.384em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9384em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.9384em;margin-right:0.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.344em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter sizing reset-size3 size6\"></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4169em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1514em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是正票占比，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是总票数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 是所选置信水平对应的正态分位数（95% 置信取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.96</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = 1.96</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span></span></span></span></span>）。这个公式的效果是：2 赞 0 踩的答案，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 约为 0.34；300 赞 8 踩的答案，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 约为 0.95。前者不会因为「零差评」而获得虚假的高位。这一方法及其动机在网络上的经典论述见 <a href=\"http://www.evanmiller.org/how-not-to-sort-by-average-rating.html\">How Not To Sort By Average Rating</a>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def rank_score(up, down, z=1.96):&#10;    n = up + down&#10;    if n == 0:&#10;        return 0.0            # 无票答案不给分，靠兜底位置展示，不参与竞争&#10;    p = up / n&#10;    denom = 1 + z*z/n&#10;    centre = p + z*z/(2*n)&#10;    margin = z * ((p*(1-p) + z*z/(4*n)) / n) ** 0.5&#10;    return (centre - margin) / denom\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rank_score</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(up, down, z</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.96</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> up </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> down</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 无票答案不给分，靠兜底位置展示，不参与竞争</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> up </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    denom </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">z</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    centre </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">z</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    margin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">z</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (centre </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> margin) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> denom</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"票数之外还该加什么\">票数之外还该加什么</h3><p>置信下界解决的是「样本量」问题，但排序还要处理三类它管不到的情况。</p>\n<p><strong>时间衰减。</strong> 一条五年前的高赞答案在快消品上可能已经过时。用一个按半衰期衰减的权重乘在票数上（而不是乘在最终分数上，因为衰减后再算下界会破坏统计含义），能同时保留「证据强度」与「新鲜度」两个维度。半衰期按品类设，硬件类可以季度级，软件类可能月度级。</p>\n<p><strong>回答者身份的边际调整。</strong> 在票数接近时，已购认证答案的排序权重应当略高于无身份答案。但调整幅度必须小——如果身份能显著压过票数，就会出现「认证用户垄断前排」的形态，非认证用户会停止贡献，而很多有价值的信息恰恰来自非认证用户的追问与补充。见 <a href=\"verified-seller-buyer-answer\">商家/已购认证答案标识</a> 对身份语义的讨论。</p>\n<p><strong>商家答案的固定位。</strong> 商家答案通常不需要竞争排序，而是固定在问题下方的首个位置，用身份徽章而非票数承担可信度。把它扔进投票竞争是错的，因为它的价值是官方口径而非民意。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[候选答案集] --&gt; B{是否为商家/品牌官方}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[固定首位&lt;br/&gt;不参与投票竞争]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D[计算加权票数&lt;br/&gt;按时间衰减折减]&#10;  D --&gt; E[计算 Wilson 下界 L]&#10;  E --&gt; F[叠加身份边际调整]&#10;  F --&gt; G[按最终分数降序]&#10;  C --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[被标记未解决或 corrected 的强制降权置底]\">graph TD\n  A[候选答案集] --&gt; B{是否为商家/品牌官方}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[固定首位&lt;br/&gt;不参与投票竞争]\n  B --&gt;|否| D[计算加权票数&lt;br/&gt;按时间衰减折减]\n  D --&gt; E[计算 Wilson 下界 L]\n  E --&gt; F[叠加身份边际调整]\n  F --&gt; G[按最终分数降序]\n  C --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[被标记未解决或 corrected 的强制降权置底]</pre><h2 id=\"审核与排序的联结点\">审核与排序的联结点</h2><p>两个管线不是完全独立的，它们有三个必须共享的地方。</p>\n<p><strong>状态共享。</strong> 一条答案被标记 <code>pending_review</code> 时，它不应参与排序（见 <a href=\"../qa-model-routing/qa-thread-model\">问答线程与状态模型</a> 中「暂挂态禁止投票」的约束）。如果排序器看不到审核状态，就会出现暂挂内容占据首页的情况。</p>\n<p><strong>举报信号回流。</strong> 审核收到的举报是排序的重要负信号。一条答案被举报次数多但尚未被判定违规，排序上应当降权——这不是预先定罪，而是风险规避：在判定完成前降低曝光，比让可能有问题的内容全量曝光再撤回要负责任。</p>\n<p><strong>「未解决」反馈。</strong> 排序器需要区分「内容质量好」与「解决了这个问题」。一条关于材质的高赞答案可能完全没有回答「能不能寄海外」这个问题本身。前者由投票表达，后者由「未解决」表达，两者叠加才能得到「既有用又切题」的排序（这套反馈闭环的口径详见 <a href=\"../qa-search-value/qa-conversion-value\">答疑对转化的价值度量</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>审核与排序应分开成两条管线：前者追求零漏放的召回，后者追求读者满意的精确，目标函数冲突时合在一起会让两者都调不准。</li>\n<li>审核分三层：硬拦截（确定性违规，带理由码）、机审标记（概率判断，需定期抽样评估模型是否失效）、人工抽检（定位为校准与训练样本，按风险分层）。</li>\n<li>有歧义的规则（如提及竞品）应进 <code>pending_review</code> 而非直接 <code>reject</code>，否则会大量误杀优质内容。</li>\n<li>排序必须用置信下界而不是原始点赞率；Wilson 下界让 2 赞 0 踩不会压过 300 赞 8 踩。</li>\n<li>时间衰减要乘在票数上而非最终分数上，才能保留分数的统计含义；半衰期按品类设定。</li>\n<li>身份调整幅度要小，并给商家答案固定位而非参与竞争；审核状态、举报信号、「未解决」反馈必须回流到排序器。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"答案审核与有用投票排序","id":"答案审核与有用投票排序"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：审核的三层规则","id":"核心概念-审核的三层规则"},{"level":3,"text":"硬拦截：确定性的违规","id":"硬拦截-确定性的违规"},{"level":3,"text":"机审标记：需要概率判断的","id":"机审标记-需要概率判断的"},{"level":3,"text":"人工抽检：校准而非全量","id":"人工抽检-校准而非全量"},{"level":2,"text":"排序为什么不能用原始点赞率","id":"排序为什么不能用原始点赞率"},{"level":3,"text":"票数之外还该加什么","id":"票数之外还该加什么"},{"level":2,"text":"审核与排序的联结点","id":"审核与排序的联结点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"商家/已购认证答案标识","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-qa-presale-system/answer-quality/verified-seller-buyer-answer"},"next":{"title":"错误/误导答案处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-qa-presale-system/answer-quality/wrong-answer-dispute"}}